James Rising is inquiring about his contract with Green Home Systems (GHS) for solar panel installation after the company stopped responding to his communications. He learns that he can directly pay the official subcontractor, LeHigh Solar, to complete the installation. He is advised to review the contract, document all communications, notify GHS of his intent to make direct payments, and consult a lawyer if necessary. James determines to inform GHS formally, asking for confirmation that payments to LeHigh Solar will be deducted from his total contract obligation. A draft communication to GHS is provided to clarify his payment intention while ensuring compliance with contractual terms.
